
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5136

### 1. Login as tom (male) and keep the token
# @name loginTom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "tom",
  "password": "Pa$$w0rd"
}

### 2. No token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members

### 3. Defaults → 200, page 1, only females (opposite of tom), newest first, tom not in list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 4. Explicit gender → 200, only males, tom not in list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members?gender=male
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 5. Age range → 200, every age between 25 and 30
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members?minAge=25&maxAge=30
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 6. Sort by name → 200, knownAs A–Z
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members?orderBy=name
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 7. Paging → 200, 2 items, page 2, totalPages = ceil(totalCount / 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members?pageSize=2&page=2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 8. Bad input → 400 with errors for Page, PageSize, Gender, MaxAge, OrderBy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members?page=0&pageSize=500&gender=fale&minAge=40&maxAge=30&orderBy=random
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 3. Defaults → 200, page 1, only females (opposite of tom), newest first, tom not in list
# @name members
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}
### 9. Member detail → 200, first member from request 3 with introduction/lookingFor/interests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members/{{members.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 10. Unknown id → 404 ProblemDetails with code "Members.NotFound"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 11. Not a guid → 404 (route constraint, never reaches the handler)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}
### 12. Update own profile → 204 No Content
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "  Kathmandu ",
  "country": "Nepal",
  "introduction": "Hi, I'm tom. Updated from the .http file.",
  "lookingFor": "   ",
  "interests": "Hiking, coffee"
}

### 13. Check it saved → 200, city "Kathmandu" (trimmed), lookingFor null (blank → null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members/{{loginTom.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}

### 14. Bad input → 400 with errors for City and Country
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTom.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "",
  "country": "",
  "introduction": null,
  "lookingFor": null,
  "interests": null
}

### 15. No token → 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "city": "X", "country": "Y" }
